{"articleNo":"2699","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2699&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 전기 졸업유예 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.04","hit":"11954","attachments":[{"name":"졸업유예신청안내및신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2699&attachNo=2389"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 19pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’휴먼옛체’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010학년도 전기 졸업예정자 졸업유예 신청 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 50%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2010학년도 전기 졸업예정자 중 졸업요건을 충족하였으나 졸업을 유예하고자 하는 학생들은 아래와 같이 안내 하오니 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">신청하시기 바랍니</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">다.<br><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">◀ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▶</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">1. 신청 자격 : 2010학년도 전기 졸업예정자 중 졸업요건 충족자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(졸업전공 및 졸업외국어 합격자)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br>3. 신청 방법 : 학생이 “졸업유예 신청서”작성&nbsp; → “학사관리팀”(G456호) 제출</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">4. 신청 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 1. 6(목) ~ 2011. 1. 10(월)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> </span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">5. 신청 장소 : 교무연구과 학사관리팀(글로벌관 456호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">6. 제출 서류 : 졸업유예 신청서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">7. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">졸업유예 등록 : 2011. 1. 13(목) ~ 1. 14(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 기성회비 1/6 해당액(위 기간에 원스톱에서 고지서 출력하여 납부)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">8. 유의사항</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① <strong><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">졸업유예 등록까지 모두 완료하여야만 졸업유예 신청이 완료</font></u></strong>되니<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 등록기간에 반드시 납부하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">등록금이 인상될 경우 차액에 대한 해당금액을 추가로 납부하여야 함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;③ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2011학년도 1학기 수강을 희망하는 자는 수강신청기간내에 수강신청을<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;하고,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;학기초과자기준으로 등록금을 납부하되, 기납부금액에서 차액만 납부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 하면 됩니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;④ 재학연한범위내에서 가능하며, 최대 4회까지 신청가능합니다.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (1회 신청시&nbsp;한학기만 신청 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2011. 1. 4</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 처&nbsp; 장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
